  "ruleModel": "Initial numbered FREE0..3 always marked. Initial FREE HIT in first5 grants one player FREE; base player FREE1, max4. No line awards. Initial FREE never raises odds. Player FREE placed after5 before unknown last3; only its later raw HIT raises global multiplier by1. Perlength final count payouts are summed, multiplied by1+player FREE hits in last3. No double odds on stacked initial FREE.",
